  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-03-20T20:57:30.452Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "PhysBoneColliders have a unique \"Plane\" option. Whilst this is useful in some regards for preventing avatar components from moving in particular directions, there is *no option to restrict its size*, which can be frustrating for certain use cases (E.G. preventing a cape from clipping the legs, but allowing it to wrap the body; A sword with a flat edge which can interact with other parts).\n \nPlease add a toggle for plane colliders to \"Limit Size\", with provided X & Y values for width and height.\n \nRelated Feedback: [Plane Shape Type on VRCContactReceiver](https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1181-plane-shape-type-on-vrccontactreceiver)",
